<title>UK: TABLE-Northern Foods yr pretax up 2.3 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Northern Foods yr pretax up 2.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.13	    vs 14.98</p>
<p> Adjusted eps (pence)   15.92	    vs 15.69</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.8		vs 5.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 9.4		vs 9.0</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    128.3	    vs 119.8</p>
<p> Pretax pre-exceps	127.1	    vs 124.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,883.6	  vs 1,956.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British dairy and food company is Northern Foods Plc. Analysts expected full-year pretax profit of around 126 million stg and a dividend of 9.3p.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
